{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"27":"Zebâih (Yani Boğazlanan Hayvanlar) Kitabı"},"section_detail":{"27":{"hadithnumber_first":3162,"hadithnumber_last":3199,"arabicnumber_first":3162,"arabicnumber_last":3199}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3197,"arabicnumber":3197,"text":"Atâ (r.a.)'den rivayet edildiğine şiire: Câbir bin Abdillah (r.a.); Biz at etlerini yerdik, dedi. Atâ (diyor ki) Ben: Ya katırlar ? dedim. Câbir: Hayır, dedi","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":27,"hadith":36}}]}